Gwenedeg's engine (src/*.c, src/*.h: qwen3.c's runq.c, since rewritten and split
into modules) and src/win.c / src/win.h are derived from qwen3.c
(https://github.com/adriancable/qwen3.c, Copyright (c) 2025 Adrian Cable, MIT),
which itself started from Andrej Karpathy's llama2.c
(https://github.com/karpathy/llama2.c, MIT).

Third-party code, data and formats (qwen3.c, ggml / llama.cpp formats, Unicode
data, Qwen chat templates and test data, LiteLLM's rubric): THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
